<title>SPAIN: Aldeasa '96 pretax profits rise 25.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Aldeasa '96 pretax profits rise 25.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for 1996 for duty-free</p>
<p>shop operator Aldeasa  ALD.CN in billions of pesetas, unless</p>
<p>stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			     7.81   up 25.75 pct</p>
<p> Net taxed				   5.1    up 27.40 pct</p>
<p> Turnover				   49.30   up 22.67 pct</p>
</text>
